  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Recamánova struktura</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> 14. 9. 2023 - 31. 12. 2023, Jindřichův Hradec </p> <p class=\"post-meta\"> Muzeum fotografie a moderních obrazových médií: Obrazy nad čísly </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <div class=\"embed embed--demo\"><span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span></div>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center figure--bordered\"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<p>Informace o výstavě na stránkách Muzea fotografie a moderních obrazových médií:<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.mfmom.cz/vystavy/obrazy-nad-cisly-i306.html\">https://www.mfmom.cz/vystavy/obrazy-nad-cisly-i306.html</a></p>\n<p>Článek z webu JcTEĎ.cz:<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.jcted.cz/76523-muzeum-fotografie-v-jindrichove-hradci-otevrelo-vystavu-pocitacovych-grafik/\">https://www.jcted.cz/76523-muzeum-fotografie-v-jindrichove-hradci-otevrelo-vystavu-pocitacovych-grafik/</a></p>\n<p>Vysvětlení Recamánovo struktury (projekt z roku 2020):<br>\n<a href=\"https://vojtamaur.cz/recamanova-posloupnost-zelvi-grafice/\">https://vojtamaur.cz/recamanova-posloupnost-zelvi-grafice/</a></p> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Recamán’s Structure</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> September 14, 2023 – December 31, 2023, Jindřichův Hradec </p> <p class=\"post-meta\"> Museum of Photography and Modern Visual Media: Images Beyond Numbers </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <div class=\"embed embed--demo\"><span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span></div>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center figure--bordered\"> <a href=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/vystavy-recamanova-struktura-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<p>\nExhibition information on the Museum of Photography and Modern Visual Media website:<br>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.mfmom.cz/vystavy/obrazy-nad-cisly-i306.html\">https://www.mfmom.cz/vystavy/obrazy-nad-cisly-i306.html</a></p>\n<p>\nArticle from the JcTEĎ.cz website:<br>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.jcted.cz/76523-muzeum-fotografie-v-jindrichove-hradci-otevrelo-vystavu-pocitacovych-grafik/\">https://www.jcted.cz/76523-muzeum-fotografie-v-jindrichove-hradci-otevrelo-vystavu-pocitacovych-grafik/</a></p>\n<p>\nExplanation of Recamán’s structure (2020 project):<br>\n\n<a href=\"https://vojtamaur.cz/recamanova-posloupnost-zelvi-grafice/\">https://vojtamaur.cz/recamanova-posloupnost-zelvi-grafice/</a></p> </div> ",
